the First, Second and Third Tranche Debentures and the First, Second and Third Tranche Warrants to $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_pid_c20231130__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__us-gaap--InvestorMember_zU7SvPkKkAOa" title="Warrant strike price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2023-11-30_us-gaap_InvestorMember" id="Fact001250" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.90</ix:nonFraction></span>. The transaction costs incurred
