valuing the convertible feature using the following assumptions: stock price $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_pid_c20240930__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ThirdTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember_zi97CMjjjwGj" title="Warrant stock price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-30_custom_ThirdTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember" id="Fact001775" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.18</ix:nonFraction></span>, dividend yield &#8211; <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DerivativeLiabilityMeasurementInput_iI_pid_dxL_uPure_c20240930__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ThirdTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember__us-gaap--MeasurementInputTypeAxis__us-gaap--MeasurementInputExpectedDividendRateMember_zXj1HOmz4Ti" title="Dividend yield::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1777">nil</span></span>, expected volatility <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DerivativeLiabilityMeasurementInput_iI_pid_uPure_c20240930__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ThirdTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember__us-gaap--MeasurementInputTypeAxis__us-gaap--MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_z559wB6q0r3b" title="Expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DerivativeLiabilityMeasurementInput" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-30_custom_ThirdTrancheDebentureConvertibleMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember" id="Fact001779" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Pure">95.0</ix:nonFraction></span>%,
