</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-09-30" escape="true" id="Fact001937" name="us-gaap:CommitmentsAndContingenciesDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80B_eus-gaap--CommitmentsAndContingenciesDisclosureTextBlock_zrk6dXmiYwWa" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>16.
<span id="xdx_825_zN6zdYZtM3N7">COMMITMENTS AND CONTINGENCIES</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Debenture
principal repayments</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-09-30" escape="true" id="Fact001939" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfMaturitiesOfLongTermDebtTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_897_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfMaturitiesOfLongTermDebtTableTextBlock_z0Umch44Aa52" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following table summarizes the future principal payments related to our outstanding debt as of September 30, 2024:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span id="xdx_8B3_ziIcDo689w77" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF
FUTURE PRINCIPAL PAYMENTS OUTSTANDING DEBT</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

