    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Start
    commercializing the Hydroxyl Devices into the US market of CEA and Food Manufacturing</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
